  "details": "<p>An inscription of \u0160ama\u0161-re\u0161a-u\u1e63ur of Suhu mentions the city/town <span>Ribani\u0161</span>\u00a0together with Alu-e\u0161\u0161u, Baqa, and Qaqqar-arad\u0101tu. It is also mentioned in\u00a0several inscriptions of <span>\u0160ama\u0161-re\u0161a-u\u1e63ur's successor\u00a0</span>Ninurta-kudurr\u012b-u\u1e63ur.</p>\r\n<p>\u00a0</p>",
  "review_state": "published",
  "type": "FeatureCollection",
  "description": "An unlocated city/town in the kingdom of Suhu, probably not far from Alu-e\u0161\u0161u, Baqa, and Qaqqar-arad\u0101tu.",
